te the table.\n\nNow for the JSON.\n```json\n{"cards": ["♠3", "♥3", "♣3", "♦3", "♥5", "♣5", "♠6", "♥6"]}\n```\n\n\n', 'output': 'Evaluation: I possess an exceptionally strong hand containing a Rocket (Black Joker + Red Joker), a Bomb (3333), and three pairs (55, 66, 99). The most efficient path to victory is to utilize the "Four with two pairs" (Quadplex set) combination. By playing the four 3s with the pairs of 5s and 6s attached, I can dispose of 8 cards in a single turn. This is superior to playing the 3333 as a standard Bomb because it clears the weak pairs (55 and 66) which would otherwise be difficult to play individually.\n\nReason: This move leaves me with only 4 cards: a pair of 9s and the Rocket. This guarantees a win. If the opponents pass, I can play the pair of 9s (and Rocket if needed) to finish. If the opponents beat this play (which requires a higher Quadplex or a Bomb), I can use the Rocket to take absolute control and then play the pair of 9s to empty my hand.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠3", "♥3", "♣3", "♦3", "♥5", "♣5", "♠6", "♥6"]}'}
